<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cstore</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cstore &lt;item&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cstore hammer
</pre>
<p>Hides an item from your inventory under the false bottom of the clan 
chest, in the clan's secret storage. Any member of the clan can store 
things, but only at the clan chest in the clan house; only the clan Master 
and the quartermasters can take them out again (<a cmd='#'>Help Cunstore</a>). The 
storage holds 25 items, and they are kept when the game reboots. A 
container must be empty to be stored.
</p><p>To see what is stored, use <a cmd='#'>Help Cequipment</a>. To send an item to the 
clan chest from anywhere, see <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Donate</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cunstore</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cequipment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Donate</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>